# Configure the agent (3.4)

Available: self-managed (GA 3.4, removed 3.5)

The agent reads `quill.yaml`, beside it. 3.5 reads a folder instead: see [Upgrade the agent](https://docs.quill.dev/3.4/upgrade/).

## Set the API key

Put the key under `key:` in `quill.yaml`. To make one, see [API keys](https://docs.quill.dev/3.4/keys/).
